#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:41
#, kde-format
msgid "The packets will be displayed just when you stop capturing them"
msgstr "Paketi će se prikazati samo kada prestanete hvatanje"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The default option is <i>showing packets when you capture it</i>. If you "
"check this, when KSniffer will capture packets it will not display them. "
"Just when you stop capturing all captured packets will be displayed.</"
"p><p>You can change this option during sniffing, but the effect will take "
"effect after you make a <b>New capture</b>. If you want simply to stop "
"packet-capture for a while you can use the <i>Pause Capture</i> feature from "
"the <i>Capture</i> menu.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Podrazumijevana opcija je <i>prikaz paketa dok ih dohvatate</i>. Ako ovo "
"označite, kada KSniffer dohvata pakete, neće ih prikazati. Samo kada "
"zaustavite dohvatanje svih paketa, prikazaće se paketi.</p><p>Možete da "
"promenite ovu opciju u toku njuškanja, ali efekat će stupiti na snagu nakon "
"što napravite<b>Novo dohvatanje</b>. Ako želite samo privremeno zaustaviti "
"dohvatanje paketa, možete koristiti <i>Pauziraj dohvatanje</i> mogućnost iz  "
"<i>Dohvaranje</i> menija.</p>"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid "KSniffer can be added to the KDE tray bar clicking here"
msgstr "KSniffer može biti dodan u tray bar KDE klikom ovdje"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The default option is <i>not showing KSniffer icon in the tray bar</i>. "
"If you want to add KSniffer to the tray bar you have to click here. In this "
"way you can access some useful KSniffer functions like start a new capure, "
"stop it, pause/continue it directly from the tray bar.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Podrazumijevana opcija je<i>ne prikazivati KSniffer ikonu u sistemskom "
"uglu</i>. Ako želite dodati KSniffer u sistemski ugao trebate kliknuti "
"ovdje. Na taj način možete pristupiti nekim korisnim KSniffer funkcijama "
"poput starta novog dohvatanja, pauziranja, nastavka direktno iz trake ugla.</"
"p>"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:57
#, kde-format
msgid "Warning when the capture stops and you got no packets"
msgstr "Upozorenje kada hvatanje stane i nemaš pakete"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you check this, you will be warn when the capture stops and you got no "
"packets. You can choose if you want to be warned with a modal window or with "
"a pop up one checking or not the following sub option.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako označite ovo, bićete upozoreni kada dohvatanje prestane i nema "
"pakete. Možete da izaberete da li želite da budete upozoreni sa modalnim "
"prozorom ili sa jednim provjerom koja će iskočiti da ili ne pratiti pod "
"opcije.</p>"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Warning with a passive pop up when the capture stops and you got no packets"
msgstr "Upozorenje s pasivnim pop up-om kad hvatanje stane i nemaš više paketa"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:63
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you check this, you will be warn when the capture stops and you got no "
"packets with a passive pop up, otherwise you will warn by a modal window "
"that stops the application till when you click on the OK button.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako označite ovo, bićete upozoreni kada dohvatanje prestane  i nemate "
"paketa s pasivnim iskokom, inače će vas upozoriti modalni prozor koji "
"zaustavlja aplikaciju i čeka da kliknete dugme U redu.</p>"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgid "It will show a splash screen at the startup"
msgstr "Pokazat će  početnu pozadinu pri pokretanju"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you check this, you will see a splash screen for some seconds at the "
"KSniffer startup.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako ovo označite, vidjećete pozdravni ekran nekoliko sekundi pri "
"pokretanju KSniffer-a.</p>"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:71
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The <b>Protocol</b> column is referred to the packets list. Changes are "
"applied just to the new packets"
msgstr ""
"Kolona  <b>Protocol</b> se odnosi na listu paketa. Promjene se primjenjuju "
"samo na nove pakete"

#: options/GuiOptionTab.cpp:73
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>If you check this, when KSniffer will detect the service application as "
"could be an IMAP, SMTP, POP3, DNS protocol you will see that names in place  "
"of just TCP or UDP (according to the relative protocol) in the <b>Protocol</"
"b> column in the packets  list.</p><p>This option has effect only on the new "
"packets. If you want to apply the change to all packets you need to reload "
"the file if you loaded one, or just restart KSniffer to have this option "
"enabled for all packets.</p><p>The protocol name is obtained from your OS "
"from the file <b>/etc/services</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako ovo označite, kada KSniffer detektuje servisnu aplikaciju koja može "
"biti IMAP, SMTP, POP3, DNS protokol vidjećete ova imena umjesto samo TCP ili "
"UDP (prema odgovarajućem protokolu) iu <b>Protokol</b> koloni liste paketa.</"
"p><p>Ova opcija ima efekat samo na novim paketima. Ako želite primijeniti "
"promjene na svim paketima trebate ponovo učitaqti datoteku, ako ste je "
"učitali ili samo ponovo pokrenuti KSniffer da imate opciju omogućenu za sve "
"pakete.</p><p>Ime protokola se dobija od vašeg OS iz datoteke <b>/etc/"
"services</b>.</p>"

